# Neurovision Clinic Homepage - .cursorrules
## Project Context
- **Project Name**: Neurovision Clinic Website
- **Purpose**: Build a professional homepage to increase the digital presence of Neurovision Clinic, showcasing its neurology and ophthalmology specialties and driving patient bookings via WhatsApp.
- **Clinic Details**:
  - Location: Ranchi, Jharkhand, India.
  - Specialties: Neurology (brain, spine, nerve care) and Ophthalmology (eye, retina care).
  - Doctors:
    - Dr. Yuvraj Lahre: MBBS, MD Medicine (Ranchi), DM Neurology (AIIMS), Gold Medalist.
    - Dr. Dibya Prabha: MBBS, MS Ophthalmology, FICO, Fellow - Retina & Vitreous (LVP Eye Institute, Hyderabad).
  - Target Audience: Patients aged 25–70 from Ranchi, Jharkhand, Bihar, West Bengal, and Chhattisgarh, including urban professionals and rural patients with varying digital literacy.
  - Regional Focus: Emphasize Ranchi as the primary location, with inclusive messaging for nearby states (e.g., "Serving Jharkhand, Bihar, West Bengal, and Chhattisgarh").
- **Website Goals**:
  - Showcase clinic specialties and doctor expertise.
  - Drive 5–10 weekly WhatsApp bookings within 3 months.
  - Achieve top 10 SEO rankings for keywords like "neurologist Ranchi," "eye specialist Jharkhand" within 6 months.
  - Build trust with patient stories and doctor credentials.

## Technical Guidelines
- **Framework**: Next.js (version 14 or later) for server-side rendering and static site generation.
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS for utility-first styling, ensuring responsive and Apple-inspired design.
- **Animations**: Use `framer-motion` for subtle animations (e.g., fade-in, scale on hover, slide-in on scroll).
- **Dependencies**:
  - `next`: For core Next.js functionality.
  - `tailwindcss`: For styling.
  - `framer-motion`: For animations.
  - `next/image`: For optimized images.
- **File Structure**:
  - Main page: `pages/index.js` for the homepage.
  - Components (optional): `components/Header.js`, `components/Section.js`, etc., for reusability.
  - Assets: `public/logo.png`, `public/hero.jpg`, `public/doctor-lahre.jpg`, `public/doctor-prabha.jpg` for images.
- **SEO**:
  - Use Next.js `<Head>` for meta tags.
  - Meta title: "Neurovision Clinic | Neurologist & Eye Specialist in Ranchi, Jharkhand".
  - Meta description: "Neurovision Clinic offers expert neurology and ophthalmology care in Ranchi for Jharkhand, Bihar, West Bengal, and Chhattisgarh. Book via WhatsApp."
  - Keywords: "neurologist Ranchi, eye specialist Jharkhand, retina care Bihar, spine doctor West Bengal, brain specialist Chhattisgarh".
  - Alt text for all images (e.g., "Neurovision Clinic exterior", "Dr. Yuvraj Lahre headshot").
- **Accessibility**:
  - Follow WCAG 2.1 guidelines: high-contrast text (e.g., black on white), alt text for images, keyboard-navigable links/buttons.
  - Use semantic HTML (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`).
  - Ensure ARIA labels for interactive elements (e.g., `aria-label="Book appointment via WhatsApp"`).

## Design Guidelines
- **Aesthetic**: Apple-inspired, with big, bold text, clear sections, rounded edges, and minimalistic visuals.
- **Typography**:
  - Font: System sans-serif (e.g., -apple-system, SF Pro Display, or fallback to Roboto) for a clean, premium look.
  - Sizes: 64px (h1), 48px (h2), 24px (subheadings), 18px (body), 14px (small text).
  - Colors: Black (#000) for primary text, gray (#4B5563) for secondary text.
- **Color Palette**:
  - Background: White (#FFF) and light gray (#F9FAFB) for sections.
  - Accents: Deep blue (#1E3A8A) for trust, green (#15803D) for WhatsApp buttons.
  - Buttons: Green (#15803D) with white text, white with blue border for secondary buttons.
- **Layout**:
  - Sections: Full-width with 50–80px padding, centered content, rounded containers (border-radius: 16px).
  - Cards: White background, soft shadow, rounded edges (border-radius: 16px).
  - Navbar: Fixed, transparent with frosted glass effect (backdrop-blur), sticky on scroll.
- **Visuals**:
  - Use high-quality, authentic images (clinic exterior, doctor headshots, patient interactions).
  - Placeholders: `/public/logo.png`, `/public/hero.jpg`, `/public/doctor-lahre.jpg`, `/public/doctor-prabha.jpg`.
  - Apply rounded edges to images (border-radius: 50% for headshots, 16px for others).
- **Animations**:
  - Subtle transitions: Fade-in on section load, scale (1.05x) on button hover, slide-in for cards.
  - Use `framer-motion` with `initial`, `animate`, and `whileInView` for scroll-triggered effects.
- **Responsive Design**:
  - Mobile: Stack sections vertically, collapse navbar to hamburger menu, large WhatsApp buttons.
  - Desktop: Grid layouts for Services and Doctors, side-by-side cards, centered content.
  - Use Tailwind classes (e.g., `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`) for breakpoints.

